<view class="page">
  <view class="eyebrow">CULTURAL DESIGN</view>
  <view class="page-title">文创展示</view>
  <view class="page-en">DESIGN OUTCOMES</view>
  <view class="intro lead">基于项目实践与苗银工艺延伸的文化设计成果，不含购买、价格或支付功能。</view>

  <view class="cards">
    <block wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id">
      <view class="design">
        <view class="design-img">
          <image src="{{item.cover}}" mode="aspectFill" />
          <view class="design-no">0{{index+1}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="design-body">
          <view class="design-title">{{item.title}}</view>
          <view class="design-intro">{{item.desc}}</view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </block>
  </view>
</view>